<body>
Dear $ADMINNAME,<br/>

<p> We regret to inform you that your Free-Trial account at $productName is set to expire on $DATE. However, we are
    committed to providing efficient customer service and would like to inform you of your next possible steps on your
    ongoing journey with $productName.
    </p>

    <p> If you would like to make a subscription to continue using $productName click 'My Account' and then 'Current
    Subscription'</p>

   <p>  Should you not wish to use our services any longer; your account will be archived and securely deleted.</p>

    $companyInfo
</body>
</html>